{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9be5df71bc50bc73e5df21ae3d96bdabaf8f99a576f8d4dcb157e7c906f598fd", "ja": "（今日は『魔法学園』シリーズの撮影。\nやよいは、厳格な教師を演じている……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄《魔法学园》系列。弥生正在饰演一位严厉的教师……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "1c347301617b0af043681b400921fbcdd62a3eb9de6d15664a2105fdf7c6c99c", "ja": "いいですか？　何事も、基礎がもっとも重要です。\n魔法を行使する際は、決して無理をしないこと。", "zh": "明白了吗？无论做什么，基础都是最重要的。\n施展魔法时，绝对不要勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "1e921d352f13fc0f8c431268b1f2ea12d4d0ecc541e978d7da4b2459d0b7f60e", "ja": "これを怠れば、たちまち暴走を招きます。\n己と仲間を危険に晒さぬよう、肝に銘じておきなさい。", "zh": "一旦疏忽，立刻就会引发失控。务必牢记，切勿让自己和同伴置于危险之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1003_p", "source_sha256": "423dd94bcb8b571ebd3433f00d8df495a3aeccfdbd9e3910dad958981a9be1bd", "ja": "（さっきのシーン、すごくいい演技だったな。\nさっそくやよいを労いに……おや？）", "zh": "（刚才那场戏演得真好啊。赶紧去慰劳一下弥生……咦？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "70e1d47503908f5713b1d4192306693e1e74c86911e58f4c75a27aa3ce631191", "ja": "ううん、お礼なんて大丈夫だよ。\nこの後も、一緒に撮影がんばろー！　またあとでね！", "zh": "不用不用，不用跟我道谢啦。\n待会儿的拍摄也一起加油吧～！回头见哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d65332f2751862db8c77a7a2f7ae5d605a9021990de4a518729346489557c7d3", "ja": "お疲れ様。……今のは、今回の生徒役のみんなか？\n何を話してたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了。……刚才那些，是这次饰演学生的大家吗？\n你们刚才在聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "211df72cd177631ca683984df43f530e913feed14a2bedcf2a7030df4863c6b8", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\n演技のことで、いろいろお話してたんです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n我们刚才在聊演戏方面的各种事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "2816cffb83db127df8fd6f66ebea070313f4e50b7d30da8af8129cc6f8e84ef1", "ja": "そういえば、最近よく聞かれるかも……。\n「お芝居のコツを教えてください！」とか、いろいろ。", "zh": "说起来，最近好像经常有人问我……  \n比如“请教教我演戏的诀窍！”之类的，还有很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1008_p", "source_sha256": "30b90bc68089f5e05558d02590167ce86fe1427a8862a0c4360e313b1c25c48b", "ja": "へえ。すごいじゃないか。\nどんな風に教えてあげてるんだ？", "zh": "哦，挺厉害的嘛。你都是怎么教她们的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "55e25b201aae4fddba396dd02b19ca20935268c429f93dc70d8e34863c4b8395", "ja": "えーっと……コツとかはわからないんですけど、\n目を見て、なるべく丁寧に教えるようにしてるんです。", "zh": "呃……我也不知道什么诀窍，\n只是会看着对方的眼睛，尽量耐心地教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "12544bbb4eb40f4bfd3ba52ce8d845dbdfaabe2e4baf74acd5803dd0173ecb65", "ja": "実は、私の学校に、授業がわかりやすい先生がいて。\n観察したり、たくさん質問して、研究しました！", "zh": "其实，我们学校里有位老师讲课特别好懂。\n我仔细观察他，还提了好多问题，认真钻研了一番呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1011_p", "source_sha256": "af99ac56660e7a2da1dec9679ede976233f9c3613266c3f871320e6b376b7e4b", "ja": "そうだったのか。そんなところから吸収してるんだな。\nえらいぞ、やよい。", "zh": "原来是这样。你就是从这种地方学习的啊。真棒，弥生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "b861815a2b2d0cd6f3492cdc3e8e2413034f4127ccdc58ab206daa3205dec430", "ja": "えへへ、ほめられちゃいました♪\nあ、でも先生から学んだだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，被夸奖了♪\n啊，不过也不只是向老师学习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "577410afb2533ed4cb63fa17d5851a93258c4bdb78c3d0a94d9dd53b1fb16f34", "ja": "家でも、妹や弟の勉強をみてるからかもしれません。\n演技を教える時も、おんなじ気持ちになりますから！", "zh": "可能也是因为在家里，我也经常辅导弟弟妹妹学习吧。\n教演戏的时候，也是一样的心情呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "3cfdae7fb914cb8c10df076a4da17bbac22a6e30f9804ee3aca0117177710e41", "ja": "こうするとわかりやすく説明できるかな、とか……\nお手本を見せるのもいいな、とか！", "zh": "这样是不是就能讲得更清楚呢……之类的。\n或者，给大家做个示范也不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4fd953f437b2ecd7dff4c291180fdeef8a09bb26dac16413fb88166381d13f8d", "ja": "おお～。気づかないうちに、\nやよいも、頼りになる先生になっていたわけだな。", "zh": "哦哦～也就是说，不知不觉间，弥生也已经成了可靠的老师啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "63396ab51d1e133dc300dfa32749b244d384d8f22e1c5a415333581185c6990f", "ja": "えへへっ♪　そうかー。私、先生のこと、\nすごいなーって思ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 原来是这样啊。我一直觉得老师很厉害来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "3bc32c38d9ef96b04cb04254ce663f82709fede651144d598697be6eeac2b985", "ja": "知らないうちに、近づけてたんですね！\nうっうー！　すっごくうれしいです！", "zh": "不知不觉间，我已经在向您靠近了呢！\n哇哦——！真的超级开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d9ebb72aff9122016831e4af2f30089981767dd546d229415598c37aecf1f48b", "ja": "ああ。やよいの役作りにもなって、みんなの成長にも\nなる……。この調子で、いい撮影にしていこう！", "zh": "啊。既能帮助弥生塑造角色，也能让大家有所成长……就照这个势头，把这次拍摄顺利完成吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0604_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "4145a8a7e9771d0f8d0d087700506d2c70b398372258fb0034d16f0c3cd5dfe8", "ja": "もちろんです！　これからも、頼りになる\n先生でいられるよう……がんばりまーっす！", "zh": "那是当然！　为了今后也能当个值得依靠的\n老师……我会加油的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
